1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,500
GHOST PROTOCOL
A browser heist that teaches cybersecurity.

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:09,000
Keys grant access. Copies do too.
In this fictional lab, a pursuer copies your Vault key.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:14,000
Revoke the key. Keep your way out.
Disable exposed access without stopping unrelated work.

4
00:00:14,220 --> 00:00:19,500
A digital key opens specific doors.

5
00:00:19,940 --> 00:00:23,810
In this lab, the pursuer
copies your Vault key.

6
00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:27,180
Cross into cyan.
Lock Vault behind you.

7
00:00:27,310 --> 00:00:33,310
Disable the key.
Its copy stops working too.

8
00:00:33,440 --> 00:00:35,860
Check that access is denied.

9
00:00:36,320 --> 00:00:40,600
Vault and Transit
are separate permissions.

10
00:00:40,750 --> 00:00:46,520
Each key opens its own gates.

11
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:50,990
Lock Vault.
Leave Transit available.

12
00:00:51,140 --> 00:00:55,960
Copied Vault access is blocked.

13
00:00:56,140 --> 00:01:00,890
Your exit still works.

14
00:01:01,480 --> 00:01:05,600
Now take the defender’s seat.

15
00:01:05,820 --> 00:01:11,880
Block the risky action.
Keep legitimate work moving.

16
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:20,200
Your turn. Find your way out.
